      echo "ok chart-analytic: two chart parts, a line chart over B2:B101 with a linear trendline showing its equation, fixed error bars of 1.5, drop lines, its value axis 0 to 50 by 10 and its category axis skipping 2 labels, and a line chart over the date column Y2:Y101 with a date axis of base unit days and major unit 2 days and a value axis of log base 10"
      echo "ok chart-text: one chart part, a bar chart over B2:B101 with style 26, the title emend text, its category axis's txPr of sz 1400 bold with the latin typeface Arial, and labels showing the values with a txPr of sz 900"
      echo "ok named-style: one cellStyle emend named style with no builtinId, its cellStyleXfs format naming a bold font and a linear gradient fill of degree 90 over FF336699 at 0 and FFDDEEFF at 1, and A101's cell format naming it by xfId"
